  "solution": {
    "text": "As,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>Ι</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup> <mi>e</mi> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mi>g</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup> <mi>g</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>e</mi> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </msup> <msup> <mi>g</mi> <mrow> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow> </math><br />Thus,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />i.e. <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> &amp; <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0018_02407a1577b5.png\" style=\"width:2.42708in;height:1.32708in\" /><br />Which intersect at&nbsp;<math><mi>‘</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>’</mi></math> points."
